Nitrogen and phosphorus are two of the main&nbsp;
components of fertilizer. And currently, though&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:45.840
mostly synthetically produced and mined. But&nbsp;
every day we excrete millions of pounds of these&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:50.880
